      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Let me report it again. The lag spikes are even more harder and worser when world has many players. Saw it on Septh 11th, and i must say it's not funny problem. \nIt affect for all streamers too. When someone join or change the avatar, you can even see streamer froze a bit. \nLong time ago, avatar loading is good controlled. Now it's like client really pauses for a moment when avatar is loading (always at 100%). Heavy avatars have even longer freezes.\nYou should really look at it and try optimize it more. Nobody want freeze a lot in busy worlds. Do you want see Lolathon freeze a lot in the stream? I bet you don't like it.\nMy last stream at 11th Sept in lesson room, i can see how everyone react on freezes. We're signing too, and it freeze. That is not good for signing, because you will miss a part (compared to voice, which has different channel).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
