      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After the latest update (2020.3.3p2, build 996.) i have this issue, and for me its making the game unplayable on any public map, because if i join somewhere, my ping goes higher than 1000, youtube videos stop loading, and then my internet just dies, then the game kick me with the reason you are timed out. If i not getting kicked, then if someone change avatar or join, my game just hang while the avatar is not loaded.(for me its net-lag not FPS-lag, disabling avatars in the security tag helps)",
